; Chart of accounts — persona física, RESICO (MX). Applied with
; BeancountLedger.apply_template(ws, "mx_resico_pf"). Dates are the 2000-01-01 floor;
; accounts used before being listed here are opened automatically at first use.
;
; Expense leaves mirror the default MX personal labels: users think in labels,
; the engine thinks in accounts.

option "operating_currency" "MXN"

; --- Assets ---------------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:BBVA
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Banorte
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Santander
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Nu
2000-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2000-01-01 open Assets:Receivable:Clients
2000-01-01 open Assets:Investments:Cetes
2000-01-01 open Assets:FixedAssets:Equipo

; IVA paid on purchases that is creditable against IVA trasladado (LIVA art. 5).
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:IVA-Acreditable
; ISR withheld by personas morales on our invoices (LISR art. 113-J) — credits against ISR.
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:ISR-Retenido
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:IVA-Retenido

; --- Liabilities ----------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:BBVA
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:Amex
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Loans:Auto
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Loans:Personal
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Loans:Infonavit
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payable:Suppliers
; IVA charged to clients and owed to SAT.
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:IVA-Trasladado
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:ISR-Payable

; --- Income ---------------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Income:Freelance
2000-01-01 open Income:Platform
2000-01-01 open Income:Interest
2000-01-01 open Income:Rent
2000-01-01 open Income:Dividends
2000-01-01 open Income:Other

