2000-01-01 open Expenses:Housing:Utilities
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Housing:Internet
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Transport:Fuel
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Transport:Rideshare
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Transport:Maintenance
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Health:Medical
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Health:Pharmacy
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Health:Insurance
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Education
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Software
